ce width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, only statement II is true.</p>\n</div></div>",
